  "abstract_summary": "eleman is a repository that an AI assistant reads and writes as its long-term memory: plain markdown files, a directory convention, a few standard-library scripts and git underneath. New information enters through an append-only inbox and is distilled into small, budgeted domain files by a periodic consolidation run...",
